  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 📖 CSV Schema\n",
    "\n",
    "| Column | Description |\n",
    "|--------|-------------|\n",
    "| `filename` | PNG filename (e.g. `myproject_desktop_001.png`) |\n",
    "| `slug` | Sanitized site identifier |\n",
    "| `mode` | `desktop` or `mobile` |\n",
    "| `index` | 3-digit sequential index per (slug, mode) |\n",
    "| `url` | The `live_url` that was screenshotted |\n",
    "| `scroll_y` | Vertical scroll position in pixels |\n",
    "| `viewport_width` | Browser viewport width |\n",
    "| `viewport_height` | Browser viewport height |\n",
    "| `device_name` | Mobile device profile (empty for desktop) |\n",
    "| `captured_at` | ISO 8601 UTC timestamp |\n",
    "| `status` | `ok` or `timeout` |\n",
    "\n",
    "Use this CSV to feed into your CV training pipeline (e.g. with `torch.utils.data.Dataset` or `tensorflow.keras.utils.image_dataset_from_directory`)."
   ]
